p.src:
Send a right-moving light ray from the origin. Let $A$ be its intersection with the middle worldline. The two equations at $A$ are $\begin{aligned}
x&=t,\\
x&=vt+L.\end{aligned}$ Substitution gives $t=vt+L,$ and hence $t_A=x_A=\frac{L}{1-v}.$

